    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【音乐园】是一个用音乐讲故事的节目，通过这个节目，我们一起分享音乐，互相陪伴，建立共鸣。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【众神的派对】系列，将记录下之前所举办的黑暗听歌会中，一些让我感觉到回味悠长的分享内容，</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期所回顾的听歌会，主题叫做【秋日遗绪】，至于黑暗听歌会究竟是什么，大家分享了怎样的故事和歌曲，欢迎结合长图收听本期节目。⬇️⬇️⬇️</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loLhh2zeD9EA1GFmD_pEM9uVB5J8.png"></figure><span></span><h2><span>｜音乐时间轴</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> Sgt. Pepper’s lonely heart club band | The Beatles</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="146">02:26</a> 你生 | 古巨基</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="571">09:31</a> Hang Me , Oh Hang Me &nbsp;| Oscar Isaac</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1278">21:18</a> 暮春秋色 | 窦唯，译乐队</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1387">23:07</a> Tequila Sunset | Zeming Xu feat. 山贼 Gulico</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1821">30:21</a> 塞尔达传说： 旷野之息主题曲｜片岡真央</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2078">34:38</a> 雾都孤儿｜张玮玮，郭龙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2173">36:13</a> 生日快乐歌｜Goose house</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2583">43:03</a> All Is Forgiven | Alekesam</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2826">47:06</a> September | Earth, Wind &amp; Fire</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3386">56:26</a> 恋爱症候群 | 黄舒骏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3410">56:50</a> 恋爱症候群 | 佐田雅志</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4007">66:47</a> All Too Well (10 Minutes Version) | Taylor Swift</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4397">73:17</a> Ashokan Farewell | Jay Ungar, Molly Mason, Fiddle Fever</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4739">78:59</a> 青春舞曲2000 | 群星</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4809">80:09</a> 东方之珠 | 罗大佑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5148">85:48</a> Love Again | Late Troubles, Reonda, Broken Thoughts</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5472">91:12</a> 升c小调第4号幻想曲, 遗作 | 李云迪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5671">94:31</a> 最好的时光 | 安溥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6034">100:34</a> Sgt. Pepper’s lonely heart club band | The Beatles</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>| 相关链接：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>如果你对本期节目意犹未尽👉</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/660d0654c891c06e731420d9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/660d0654c891c06e731420d9"><span>《音乐进化论》 EP21.秋日来信</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>如果你需要本期听歌会纯享音乐歌单👉黑暗听歌会纯享歌单｜秋日遗绪</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你想参加听歌会，或者加听友群👉361548739（微信）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>｜其他：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>公众号（发布听歌会活动信息）：拥挤的音乐园</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书（记录生活碎片）：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5968a60e82ec390605fe3314?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5968a60e82ec390605fe3314&amp;apptime=1733405615&amp;share_id=5ccbe6e4ccfa40ee9f9388e90614fa0c" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5968a60e82ec390605fe3314?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5968a60e82ec390605fe3314&amp;apptime=1733405615&amp;share_id=5ccbe6e4ccfa40ee9f9388e90614fa0c"><span>古斯的乐园</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>如果有一些歌曲也曾给你带来过相似的感受，欢迎在评论区留言，说不定哪一天，我就会联系到你，把你的故事做成一期节目</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果大家喜欢这个节目，欢迎订阅，点赞或转发，这对我意义重大</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目已经在网易云音乐，苹果播客，荔枝FM，喜马拉雅，QQ音乐同步上架。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们下期见👋</span></p>]]></description>
